  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"introduction\">简介</h2><p>YARP 1.1 借助 .NET 7 中的 HTTP/3 支持,为入站和出站连接提供 HTTP/3 支持。要在 YARP 中启用 HTTP/3 协议,你需要:</p>\n<p>在 Kestrel 中配置入站连接 在 HttpClient 中配置出站连接</p>\n<h2 id=\"set-up-http-3-on-kestrel\">在 Kestrel 上设置 HTTP/3</h2><p>需要在监听器选项中指定协议:</p>\n<pre class=\"code-block standalone\"><span class=\"lang-tag\">C#</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" data-copy=\"http3-code-1\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg class=\"copy\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"check\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></button><code id=\"http3-code-1\">   <span class=\"tok-type\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></span> builder <span class=\"tok-punc\">=</span> WebApplication<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span><span class=\"tok-type\">CreateBuilder</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">(</span>args<span class=\"tok-punc\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">;</span>\n   builder<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span>WebHost<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span><span class=\"tok-type\">ConfigureKestrel</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">(</span>kestrel <span class=\"tok-punc\">=&gt;</span>\n   <span class=\"tok-punc\">{</span>\n          kestrel<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span><span class=\"tok-type\">ListenAnyIP</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">(</span><span class=\"tok-num\">443</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">,</span> portOptions <span class=\"tok-punc\">=&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-punc\">{</span>\n                 portOptions<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span>Protocols <span class=\"tok-punc\">=</span> HttpProtocols<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span>Http1AndHttp2AndHttp3<span class=\"tok-punc\">;</span>\n                 portOptions<span class=\"tok-punc\">.</span><span class=\"tok-type\">UseHttps</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">;</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-punc\">}</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">;</span>\n   <span class=\"tok-punc\">}</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punc\">;</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"httpclient\">HttpClient</h2><p>应将 HttpRequest 的默认版本替换为 &quot;3&quot;;有关 HttpRequest 配置的更多详细信息,请参阅相关文档。</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01M11 12h1v5h1\"/></svg><div><div class=\"head\">说明</div><p>本文作者在 AI 的协助下创作本文。了解详情</p>\n</div></div>",
